  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the ground cardamom and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for another minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes, red pepper flakes, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 15-20 minutes, or until the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro and serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
